===============================================
Standard .gitignore for Java / KUKA Projects
(IntelliJ, VS Code, Eclipse, Build Outputs)
===============================================
-----------------------------------------------
1. BUILD/OUTPUT DIRECTORIES AND FILES
-----------------------------------------------
Target directories for various build tools

bin/
target/
build/
deploy/
out/
dist/
temp/
tmp/
Compiled Java class files

*.class
Package Files

*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar
*.7z
Log files

*.log
logs/
nohup.out
-----------------------------------------------
2. IDE SPECIFIC FILES (IntelliJ, VS Code, Eclipse)
-----------------------------------------------
IntelliJ IDEA (The primary ignore for this IDE)

.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
/gen/ # Generated sources directory common in some setups
VS Code

.vscode/
Eclipse

.classpath
.project
.settings/
-----------------------------------------------
3. OPERATING SYSTEM / SHELL IGNORES
-----------------------------------------------
OS-generated files

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Shell/history files

*~
Vim/Nano temp files

.swp
.fuse_hidden
-----------------------------------------------
4. KUKA ROBOT SPECIFIC FILES (Adjust if needed)
-----------------------------------------------
These paths are based on typical KUKA WorkVisual projects or external build setups.
If your project outputs other specific generated files, add them here.
Assuming you only commit source code and build files are regenerated.

WorkVisual/
RobotProject/!bin/
!bin/
